  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 845f4109b43e0dc51ba1d24821bf8a4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  comment: 'This cube is used as a reference to vertex-snap the cut-out Begin or
    Extent transforms when the product model does not have useful geo to snap to
    (i.e., it is sized incorrectly or doesn''t have square corners)


    This reference
    helps ensure the model doesn''t over stretch to match the cut-out. This would
    happen if the model''s cut-out geo doesn''t match the size provided by the client
    the "render cut-out with product" option is enabled (i.e. the product has holes
    or is inset into the cabinet). When the "render cut-out with product" option
    is enabled, the model intentionally scales 1:1 to seal the cut-out area'
